Minor spolier 

My wizard was just on level three digging holes with his pick axe.  I dug  
a hole in a room, mucked about a bit, poked my head back into the room to  
see it full of hill orcs.  Now here I am running down the hall, but wait,  
whats this?! I can still see all those orcs in the room.  Just what Peter  
Snelling was talking about the other day.  So I figured out exactly what  
happened, it seems to be a bug of minor use.  Basically, you dig a hole in  
the corner of a room, then you enter the hole at 90 degrees and exit the  
hole at 45 degrees (shown below).  Now you will be able to see all in the  
room until you enter the room again or another room.

        ______
       |......|
       |......+      enter the open corner from 1 and exit onto 2
      2+......|
      #.______|      
       1

or
        ______
       |......|
       |......+      enter the open corner from 1 and exit onto 2
      #+......|
      1.______|      
      ##2#


